sequenceDiagram
    actor Admin
    participant UI as Admin Orders UI
    participant API as AdminOrderController
    participant DB as Order database
    participant Outbox as Existing after-commit dispatcher
    participant PubSub as Google Pub/Sub
    Admin->>UI: Select row, Cancel or Complete
    UI->>API: GET admin/penalty-policies
    API-->>UI: Shared enum cases and amounts
    Admin->>UI: Penalty choice + preset/custom reason + confirm
    alt Live provider
        UI->>API: POST admin/{id}/cancel or complete
        Note over API,DB: Existing verified admin role; locked participant/state checks
        API->>DB: Atomic status + decision/reason + checkpoint + bound receipt + outbox
        DB-->>API: Commit
        API-->>UI: Updated Order (funding/scoring intent)
        Outbox->>PubSub: Existing credit event + optional highest penalty
    else Local mock provider
        UI->>API: POST admin-mock/orders/{id}/cancel or complete
        Note over API: Update sample memory only; no DB, funds, outbox or score
        API-->>UI: Updated sample Order
    end
    UI-->>Admin: Refresh list / show saved full details
